From 2f098ae69cb6254e163836c8bc772bed4b651520 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:04:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/15] feat: enumerate configured media profiles without a
 two-stream limit

Share Media1 and Media2 profile, encoder configuration and URI handling.
Build responses with ezxml so each configured stream retains its token
and parameters regardless of its index or the number of sibling streams.
Exercise empty configurations and up to twelve streams through CGI.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
